# textdomain: vl_tridents
Trident=Lyster
Water element=Vannelement

Tridents are great in melee combat, as they have an increased reach. They can also be thrown.=Lystrer fungerer bra i nærkamp, da de har lengre rekkevidde. De kan også kastes.

To throw a trident, hold it in your hand, then hold use (rightclick) in the air.=For å kaste en lyster, hold den i hånden, deretter hold bruk-knappen (høyreklikk) ut i luften.
